sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as Room (one tx)
    participant W as Drainer (Ch 30)
    participant Srv as Backend

    User->>Repo: add to cart (offline)
    Repo->>DB: transaction - upsert entity PENDING + insert outbox entry (key K)
    DB-->>Repo: committed (atomic)
    Note over W: connectivity returns - Ch 68
    W->>DB: read PENDING entries in order
    W->>Srv: apply(type, K, payload) [Idempotency-Key K]
    Srv-->>W: 200 (server state)
    W->>DB: remove entry K, mark entity SYNCED
